        "r": 548.3729085599991,
        "b": 642.0194905100001
      },
      "content": "The caution items are classified into 'Warning' and 'Caution'. The 'Warning' items are especially important since they can lead to death or serious injury if they are not followed closely. The 'Caution' items can also lead to serious accidents under some conditions if they are not followed. Therefore, be sure to observe all the safety caution items described below.",
